@startuml 用例图
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor 乘客 as Passenger

rectangle 武汉地铁模拟运行系统 {
  usecase "查询线路与站点信息\n(某站线路数、某线站点数)" as UC01
  usecase "查询中转站" as UC02
  usecase "查询附近站点\n(线路距离小于n的站点)" as UC03
  usecase "查询两点间全部无环路径" as UC04
  usecase "查询最短路径" as UC05
  usecase "简洁展示乘车方案" as UC06
  usecase "计算乘车票价" as UC07
  usecase "单程票计价" as UC07a
  usecase "武汉通计价(9折)" as UC07b
  usecase "定期票计价(0元)" as UC07c
}

Passenger --> UC01
Passenger --> UC02
Passenger --> UC03
Passenger --> UC04
Passenger --> UC05
Passenger --> UC07

UC05 ..> UC06 : <<include>>
UC07 ..> UC04 : <<include>>
UC07a --|> UC07
UC07b --|> UC07
UC07c --|> UC07
@enduml
